19:07.620 --> 19:08.680
How?

19:08.680 --> 19:12.710
If he's a perverted ghost,
then there's an easy way.

19:12.710 --> 19:14.710
I see.

19:14.710 --> 19:17.090
If I hide here...

19:20.590 --> 19:23.600
Come on out, slouching ghost!

19:27.600 --> 19:30.350
<i>That's against the rules!</i>

19:30.350 --> 19:33.800
<i>I-I can't look! If I get
excited, they'll see me...</i>

19:34.810 --> 19:38.490
<i>My mind says one thing,
but my eyes aren't listening!</i>

19:39.240 --> 19:40.990
<i>Bounce, bounce...</i>

19:43.710 --> 19:45.490
Over there! I found him.

19:50.250 --> 19:51.040
This way!

19:51.040 --> 19:52.080
He went that way!

19:52.080 --> 19:53.380
Wait!

19:53.380 --> 19:54.630
You aren't getting away!

19:53.540 --> 19:53.670
That way!

19:54.640 --> 19:57.950
Wait!

19:58.920 --> 20:01.490
What has everyone so riled up?

20:03.810 --> 20:04.830
Oh, Taketo?

20:05.620 --> 20:08.050
I thought it was noisy around here.
So that was you?

20:08.050 --> 20:09.310
You can see me?

20:09.310 --> 20:11.450
I can tell without needing to see you.

20:12.960 --> 20:14.060
How?

20:14.060 --> 20:16.340
You're my photographic subject.

20:16.340 --> 20:19.190
I'm always watching you, so I can tell.

20:23.010 --> 20:25.070
You aren't going to turn me in to them?

20:25.070 --> 20:29.080
I don't know what you did,
but do you want me to?

20:35.070 --> 20:37.290
So, you can take photos like this, too?

20:37.290 --> 20:38.960
Oh, that?

20:41.780 --> 20:44.320
One guy and two girls.

20:44.320 --> 20:47.470
A person can smile and laugh
until they show their true selves.

20:48.470 --> 20:50.460
Did something happen?

20:50.460 --> 20:53.970
But even after you show how
ugly you really are,

20:53.970 --> 20:56.360
I guess you can still smile.

20:56.360 --> 20:58.860
Lately, I've started to think that.

20:59.350 --> 21:03.780
Someday, I might want to take
another photo like this.

21:03.780 --> 21:05.120
Raika...

21:13.680 --> 21:18.390
I use this escape route when I want to
leave the dorm to take photos.

21:18.390 --> 21:19.700
I'll let you use it.

21:19.700 --> 21:20.880
Th-Thanks.

21:20.880 --> 21:23.220
Why are you helping me escape?

21:23.220 --> 21:27.510
I'd be bored if you got expelled and I couldn't
take any more photos of you...

21:27.510 --> 21:30.050
Get going, already.

21:37.610 --> 21:39.860
Raika! Did you see a ghost?

21:39.860 --> 21:41.000
Yeah, I did.

21:41.000 --> 21:41.860
Where'd it go?

21:41.860 --> 21:43.380
It ran.

21:43.380 --> 21:46.740
We should seal this place,
so it never comes back.

21:53.370 --> 21:55.370
Girls' dorm

21:53.370 --> 21:55.370
