21:57.330 --> 21:58.770
People really like it.

21:58.770 --> 22:01.960
They say it's a new seven mysteries
for the girls' dorms.

22:01.960 --> 22:05.920
Blood dripping from thin air...
Words written in blood on a mirror.

22:05.920 --> 22:06.970
And...

22:06.970 --> 22:09.280
What happened to my report?!

22:09.280 --> 22:12.470
It's there. In the left corner.

22:14.460 --> 22:19.100
It was a wonderful place.

22:14.470 --> 22:19.100
Special Report on

22:14.470 --> 22:19.100
the Girls' Dorms!

22:19.100 --> 22:21.020
Anonymous reporter.

22:21.020 --> 22:22.270
That's all?

22:22.270 --> 22:24.960
