22:29.610 --> 22:32.370
Jeez, you've gotta be kidding me...

22:33.820 --> 22:36.730
Hey there, that FLASHY POWER needs more energy!

22:36.730 --> 22:39.770
Shout HURRAY, and raise the words of PEACE to the sky!

22:51.300 --> 22:54.220
Come, be HAPPY first thing in the morning; love KNOWS the outcome of the underwear battle!

22:54.220 --> 22:57.020
Hold on! Keep this a secret, it feels awfully squishy down below; it feels amazing.

22:57.020 --> 22:58.460
Since you're taking a peek, darling,

22:58.460 --> 22:59.870
